   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) # of jointly agreed research consultancies launched
2) # of agreed country pilots designed, coordinated and launched
3) existence of finalized project document and MPTF</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2018">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) 0
2) 0
3) draft UNDP project document</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) 3
2) 8
3) draft UNDP project document approved and MPTF established</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) 4 (i: data protection and privacy, ii: biometrics, iii: cost of inaction, iv: standardisation of national ID)
2) 10 countries with rapid assessment missions (Cameroon, Cote DIvoire, DRC, Kenya, Liberia, Mozambique, Niger, Nigeria, Sierra Leone, Zambia), 4 countries received financial and technical support (Cameroon, Kenya, Zambia from UNLIA and Namibia)
3) UNDP prodoc was approved and project was initiated. MPTF had to be delayed due to donor withdrawal because of Covid-19</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) 3
2) 8
3) draft UNDP project document approved and MPTF established</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) 6 (2 on data protection and privacy, 1 on biometrics, 1 on cost of inaction, 1 on free movement zone and 1 on human rights)
2) 10 countries with rapid assessment missions (Cameroon, Cote DIvoire, DRC, Kenya, Liberia, Mozambique, Niger, Nigeria, Sierra Leone, Zambia), 4 countries received financial and technical support (Cameroon, Kenya, Zambia from UNLIA and Namibia), 6 countries received financial and technical support (DRC, Kenya, Liberia, Mozambique, Sierra Leone and Zambia)
3) MPTF has not been established due to the lack of funding</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
